# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 1 — Groq (FREE + least restrictive — RECOMMENDED)
# Fastest AI available. Runs Llama 4. Fewer refusals on business tasks.
# Get your free key in 60 seconds (no credit card):
#   1. Go to console.groq.com
#   2. Sign in with Google
#   3. Click "API Keys" → "Create API Key"
#   4. Paste it below
# Free limits: 1,000 requests/day, 30 requests/minute
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GROQ_API_KEY=paste_your_groq_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 2 — Google Gemini (free, more restricted than Groq)
# Only needed if you're not using Groq.
# Get key at: aistudio.google.com
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GEMINI_API_KEY=paste_your_gemini_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 3 — Anthropic Claude (paid, most restricted)
# Only needed if you prefer Claude over Groq/Gemini.
# Get key at: console.anthropic.com
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=paste_your_claude_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TELEGRAM BOT TOKEN (required for iPhone/iPad access)
# Get it free from @BotFather on Telegram (takes 2 minutes)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=paste_your_telegram_token_here
